# Chinese translation, generated from the project's translation table.

msg-selec00-0 = 
    The gate is heavily guarded, but most of the guards are watching for people trying to get into the city illegally, not for those trying to leave. <br><p>
    你决定去...<br><p><opt>...<indent>simply walk out of the city, right past the guards. <br><p><opt>...<indent>混在离城的人群中，凭借敏捷与街头智慧潜出。<br><p><opt-items>...<indent>use an alchemical distraction, then slip past the guards. <br><p><opt-saints>...<indent>呼唤圣人以求援助。<br><p><opt-battle>...<indent>draw weapons and attack the guards! <br><p><opt>...<indent>试问是否可由城墙离城。<br><p><opt>...<indent>暂且勿离此城。<br>
msg-selec00-1 = 
    趁守卫不备偷溜出去时，一个顽童试图扒 $ChosenOneName 的口袋，$he 怒不可遏，竟忘了形迹大喊出声。守卫的注意力立刻被引向你们一行。
msg-selec00-2 = 
    Easily, you slip by the guards and out the gate. Soon $PlaceName is far behind you. <br>
msg-selec00-3 = 
    随即一股恶臭袭来，栅栏周围很快便空无一人。在气味消散之前，你们用湿布捂住口鼻，冲出敞开的栅门。
msg-selec00-4 = 
    小瓶在空中旋转，骤然碎裂，一道比太阳更耀眼的光芒刺得守卫与路人目不能视。你趁乱疾步穿过混乱，冲出城门。不久，你已远离城市的喧嚣。
msg-selec00-5 = 
    Blinding fumes pour into the air, engulfing the entire gate area. While guards grope in the mist, you slip quickly out the door and leave the city. <br>
msg-selec00-6 = 
    当药剂在传送门中爆炸时，混乱四起。卫兵与百姓相撞、咒骂、倒下。你徒劳地试图冲过人群，却因不够敏捷而未能及时脱身，卫兵已恢复秩序。
msg-selec00-7 = 
    Guards and bystanders are amazed as $ChosenOneName loudly prays to $NamedOneName. A glow surrounds you all. Slowly at first, then with increasing speed, you are levitated through the air, over the city wall, and carried far outside the city's limits. The observers cry out and point after you, astounded by this exploit.{" "}
msg-selec00-8 = 
    尘埃中跪唱，$ChosenOneName对$NamedOneName歌咏多时，终无回响。事有不妥。无奈放弃，重思对策。
msg-selec00-9 = 
    You dash through the gate away from the city before more guards appear.{" "}
msg-selec00-10 = 
    Chagrined at your defeat, you run from the gate and the victorious guards. They chortle and mock as you run, not even bothering to follow you.{" "}
msg-selec00-11 = 
    The guards begin to strip your unconscious bodies. Before they are through, however, the sergeant comes by and yells at them. <br><p>
    "Get rid of these bodies! This isn't an abattoir." The soldiers aren't sure what to do with you, so they haul you to a nearby alleyway and dump you there.{" "}
msg-selec00-12 = 
    When you raise your hands in surrender, the guards are both pleased and puzzled. One asks the sergeant, "Should we kill them?" <br><p>
    他答道：“不。将他们押入地牢，由城中父老定夺其命运。”
msg-selec00-13 = 
    夜幕降临，城门紧闭，上下皆有守卫巡逻。<br><p>
    你决定去...<br><p><p><opt>...<indent>凭友善言辞与动人微笑，博得守卫信任，获准出城。<br><opt>1 不可用<br><opt>2 阁楼不可用<br><p><opt-saints>...<indent>呼唤圣人以求援助。<br><opt>4 战斗不可用<br><p><opt>...<indent>继续前行，察看城墙守备情况。<br><p><opt>...<indent>暂且勿离此城。<br>
msg-selec00-14 = 
    卫兵长见状赞许道：“你自是例外。请由此侧门出城。”他引你穿过城楼中的小径，至外。
msg-selec00-15 = 
    卫队长哈哈大笑：“你们竟指望我们为你们开城门？今夜休想，诸位！快些离开吧，免得惹怒了我们。”
msg-selec00-16 = 
    忽闻警报：“敌袭城门！”卫队长厉声喝令。旁观者四散，卫士疾奔而来。
